== Effects ==
* {{dlc|nr}} When Isaac's [[health]] is brought down to half a red heart and no soul hearts, a {{i|Little Steven}} familiar spawns for the current room.
* {{dlc|r}} When Isaac enters a room and has half a red heart or less, a Little Steven familiar spawns and will remain until red health is restored to above a Half Red Heart, disappearing after entering another room.
** Characters which cannot acquire red heart containers in any way will always have a Little Steven.
* {{dlc|r}} When Isaac takes damage, there is a chance to spawn a {{i|Gemini}} familiar for the current room. This effect is stackable.
** The chance to spawn the familiar depends on the [[luck]] stat, and the formula used to determine the chance is: <math>30% + \mathit{Luck} \times 2%</math>.
*** At 0 luck the chance is 30%, maxing out at 100% at 35 luck.

== Notes ==
* This trinket has a chance to drop from destroying [[Rocks#Polyps|polyps]] (outside of {{s|Corpse}}).

== Synergies ==
* {{A|Golden Trinket|r+}} / {{i|Mom's Box|r+}}: Having either spawns the {{i|Little Steven}} familiar if Isaac enters a room with a red heart or less. Having both spawns it if Isaac has 1 and a half red heart or less.

